  "note": "The data are rebuilt from the published means and SEs. The app gives F = 30.351 on 3 and 12 df, p < 0.0001 (η² = 0.884), equal to the independent calculation (30.3512) and consistent with the paper's '**' (p < 0.01). The paper prints no F value to compare with.",
