    "title": "Chacrabati et al. (2013) – broiler live weight, completely randomized design with 4 diets (data rebuilt from means and SE)",
    "statement": "Four diets (control, banana peel meal at 0.5 %, Bio-Sel E and a commercial additive) were each given to 4 replicate groups of broilers in a completely randomized design, and the live weight (g) was recorded. The paper prints only each diet's mean and standard error (with significance letters), so the four values of each diet were rebuilt to have exactly that mean and SD = SE × √4. Does the mean live weight differ between the diets? Test at α = 0.05. Source: Bangladesh Journal of Animal Science (2013).",
